# The images the recovery folder of the owner's master holds, each at its digest: every image the platform
# tree pulls from the owner's mirror, and the skopeo its publish run copies with. The `recovery-export` task of
# that run writes each into the folder, and lifecycle/driver.sh fetches, checks and imports each into a cold
# owner's master. scripts/check.sh holds this file to the render and prints it when it is stale.
